# Which topics each MQTT account may use. Accounts not listed get nothing.

# Frigate publishes events, snapshots and state, and takes commands.
user frigate
topic readwrite frigate/#

# Gatekeeper reads Frigate's events and publishes its results and
# Home Assistant discovery.
user gatekeeper
topic read frigate/#
topic readwrite gatekeeper/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/#

# Home Assistant sees and controls everything.
user homeassistant
topic readwrite #
